  {"comment": "The top bar's Infinite Canvas and Wrap are one Page Edges button now, and View holds it with Environment View and Double Resolution. A fresh bar hides the button, so the Elements page switches it on first, so each shot shows the menu and the button together. On a fresh document View opens with its Page Edges submenu, Grows is picked from it and a stroke painted past the right edge grows the page. Then Wraps All Edges is picked, the page wraps and no longer grows, and a second stroke past the edge leaves the size where it was. The dockers are parked first, so no click lands on one."},
